// stc.kwxts — kwxTypeScript port of wxSamples/src/stc/stctest.cpp
//
// The StyledTextCtrl test application: a Scintilla editor with its full menu
// bar, an About box, a Properties dialog, the document-map dialog and the
// separate "Minimal editor" window.
//
// Run from the repository root:
//   bin\Release\kwxts.exe samples\stc\stc.kwxts
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Conversion notes
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// * Every wxSTC_* constant used by the sample is declared in stc_consts.kwxts:
//   the bindings export none of them (see that module's header).
// * wxStyledTextCtrlMiniMap (wx/stc/minimap.h) has no binding at all, so the
//   document map's right pane is a read-only wxStyledTextCtrl showing the same
//   document.
// * Printing: wxPageSetupDialog is fully bound and File > Print Setup works.
//   File > Print Preview and File > Print need an EditPrint (wxPrintout
//   subclass): kwxFFI's kwxPrintout callbacks are void(void*,void*,void*), but
//   OnPrintPage must return bool and GetPageInfo needs four out-ints across
//   five arguments, so neither can be expressed. Those two items stay inert,
//   exactly as in a wxWidgets build with wxUSE_PRINTING_ARCHITECTURE == 0.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

